[agent] ## Missing capability — online/low-latency serving is not reachable through the tested interface
[agent] The task's second requirement (make the features available for **online/real-time low-latency lookup**, where the platform distinguishes offline vs. online) maps on Vertex AI to a **Feature Group** + **Feature Online Store** + **Feature View**. None of those command groups exist in the allowed GA surface:
